; THE CELESTIAL REALM (the finish run). The ground of the dead gods is WORKED STONE, not soil: the
; terraces were paved once, and what the Cataclysm left is dressed rock under a drift of ash, with
; scree where the edges broke away into the void. The only region whose Ground slot is stone and
; whose road is a paved way, which is what makes it read as built ground even between the ruins.
; Built from existing layers so nothing here is a new substance.
[resource]
